# and the status document and handoff file rewritten) and checks that fedora-desktop-health and
# the login shell's second reminder of the day print this checkout's run.bash --changed. With
# no play to run it says NOT JUDGED (exit 2).
00214-update-all-changed-plays
# Every play that has to run again here (issue #110 gap 3), after the acceptance above, which
# needs them still stale: ./run.bash --changed --yes, in playbook-main.yml order, stopping at
# the first failure. It is expected to pick up play-host-health-login-report.yml (Plan 00214
# changed fedora-desktop-health's --help) and play-fedora-desktop-panel.yml (the panel's
# "Re-run a play…" count now leaves out plays --changed does not run), plus every other play
# the acceptance listed as changed or failed. Needs sudo. Afterwards log out and back in so
# the panel loads its new code (Wayland), and fedora-desktop-health should list no play.
changed-plays
